# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

# This package's own build outputs for the separate consumer package.
#
# The same paths are also listed in the repository root .gitignore, because a
# build run from the repository root must not commit them either. Neither is
# named in the consumer manifest's .paths, so an ignored path can never become
# part of what `zig fetch` hands a dependent.
.zig-cache/
zig-out/
zig-pkg/
